{"id":"612358","name":"青菜豆腐包子","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/612358/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"一块"}],"sub":[{"name":"纯净水(40度左右)","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"摘好的青菜，淖一下，捞出，沥干水分。","img":"images/612358/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切碎，挤出多余的水分，放入盆中。","img":"images/612358/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"豆腐备用。","img":"images/612358/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"豆腐切碎。","img":"images/612358/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"都放入盆中。","img":"images/612358/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加适量盐、少许五香粉和鸡精，泼入热油。","img":"images/612358/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/612358/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"面粉中加酵母和温水，搅拌成絮状，醒发两倍大，揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/612358/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搓成长条状，切成大小均匀的剂子。","img":"images/612358/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"擀成中间厚四周薄的包子皮。","img":"images/612358/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/612358/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"已包好。","img":"images/612358/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"冷水上笼。","img":"images/612358/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"大火烧开转中火蒸十五分钟，关火焖五分钟。","img":"images/612358/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"已蒸好。","img":"images/612358/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/612358/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"清淡可口。","img":"images/612358/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}